<view class="navbar" style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;">
  <view style="height: {{statusBarHeight}}px;"></view>
  <view class="navbar-content" style="height: {{navBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="navbar-back" bindtap="onBack">
      <svg-icon name="back-thick" size="18px" />
    </view>
    <text class="navbar-title">会员与提醒名额</text>
  </view>
</view>
<view style="height: {{statusBarHeight + navBarHeight}}px;"></view>

<view class="page-body">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading-wrap">
    <van-loading size="36rpx" color="#B8904A" />
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{loadFailed}}" class="load-failed">
    <text class="load-failed-title">会员状态加载失败</text>
    <view class="retry-btn" bindtap="onRetry">重新加载</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="explain-card">
      <text class="explain-kicker">会员不是“抢票加速”</text>
      <text class="explain-title">{{reasonText || '会员只增加可同时开启的提醒名额'}}</text>
      <view class="quota-pair">
        <view class="quota-item">
          <text class="quota-label">免费版</text>
          <text class="quota-value">5 个</text>
        </view>
        <view class="quota-arrow">→</view>
        <view class="quota-item highlight">
          <text class="quota-label">30 天会员</text>
          <text class="quota-value">10 个</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <text class="explain-foot">¥2 一次支付，不自动续费；已有提醒不会被删除。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="status-band">
      <view class="status-head">
        <view>
          <text class="status-title">{{memberStateText}}</text>
          <text class="status-expiry">{{expiryText}}</text>
        </view>
        <text class="status-badge {{membership.member ? 'active' : ''}}">{{membership.member ? '会员' : '免费版'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="usage-row">
        <text>提醒名额 {{membership.taskUsed}} / {{membership.taskLimit}}</text>
        <text>剩余 {{membership.taskRemaining}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="usage-track">
        <view class="usage-fill" style="width: {{usagePercent}}%;"></view>
      </view>
      <text wx:if="{{membership.protectedTaskQuota > membership.entitlementTaskLimit}}" class="protected-note">已为老用户保留 {{membership.protectedTaskQuota}} 个保护名额，不额外收费，也不会删除已有提醒。</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{paymentState}}" class="payment-state {{paymentState.status}}">
      <text class="payment-state-title">{{paymentState.title}}</text>
      <text class="payment-state-desc">{{paymentState.description}}</text>
      <view wx:if="{{paymentState.orderId}}" class="payment-state-action" bindtap="onPaymentOrder">查看订单详情</view>
    </view>

    <view class="order-entry" bindtap="onOrders">
      <view class="order-entry-copy">
        <text class="order-entry-title">订单与退款</text>
        <text class="order-entry-desc">同步支付结果、申请售后、查看退款进度</text>
      </view>
      <svg-icon name="chevron-down" size="14px" rotate="270" />
    </view>

    <text class="section-label">你能得到什么</text>
    <view class="benefit-list">
      <view class="benefit-row">
        <svg-icon name="check-gold" size="16px" />
        <view class="benefit-copy">
          <text class="benefit-title">提醒名额从 5 个提升到 10 个</text>
          <text class="benefit-desc">只影响同时可开启的提醒数量，不改变景点官方预约规则。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="benefit-row">
        <svg-icon name="check-gold" size="16px" />
        <view class="benefit-copy">
          <text class="benefit-title">会员有效期内可加购提醒名额</text>
          <text class="benefit-desc">¥2 增加 5 个名额；名额永久记录，续费会员后自动恢复。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="benefit-row">
        <svg-icon name="check-gold" size="16px" />
        <view class="benefit-copy">
          <text class="benefit-title">到期不删除已有提醒</text>
          <text class="benefit-desc">不代抢、不代约，也不保证景点有票。请按官方渠道自行预约。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="section-label">选择本次服务</text>
    <view class="package-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{visiblePackages}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="package-row {{item._selected ? 'selected' : ''}} {{item._available ? '' : 'disabled'}}"
        bindtap="onPackageTap"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
      >
        <view class="package-main">
          <view class="package-title-line">
            <text class="package-title">{{item.title}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{item.badge}}" class="package-badge">{{item.badge}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="package-desc">{{item.description}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{!item._available}}" class="package-lock">{{item.actionText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="package-price">
          <text class="package-price-value">{{item.priceText}}</text>
          <view class="package-radio {{item._selected ? 'checked' : ''}}">
            <svg-icon wx:if="{{item._selected}}" name="check-white" size="11px" />
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text wx:if="{{!membership.member}}" class="package-tip">开通会员后可加购 5 个提醒名额。</text>

    <view class="purchase-note">
      <text>虚拟权益支付成功后生效。支付后 24 小时内且没有新增任何提醒，可申请退款，需客服核实；已使用、超时或无正当理由的申请原则上不支持。每笔订单最多一次全额退款。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="pay-btn {{selectedPackage ? '' : 'disabled'}}" bindtap="onPay">
      <text>{{payButtonText}}</text>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>

<view wx:if="{{showPayConfirm}}" class="modal-mask" bindtap="onClosePayConfirm">
  <view class="confirm-sheet" catchtap="noop">
    <view class="confirm-head">
      <text class="confirm-title">确认支付</text>
      <view class="confirm-close" bindtap="onClosePayConfirm">×</view>
    </view>
    <view class="confirm-row"><text>商品</text><text>{{confirmTitle}}</text></view>
    <view class="confirm-row"><text>金额</text><text class="confirm-amount">{{confirmAmount}}</text></view>
    <view class="confirm-row"><text>生效</text><text>支付成功后立即生效</text></view>
    <view class="confirm-row"><text>有效期</text><text>{{confirmExpiry}}</text></view>
    <view class="confirm-rule">
      <text>24 小时内且未新增任何提醒，可申请退款并等待客服审核；已使用、超时或无正当理由原则上不支持。</text>
      <text>不自动续费，不会删除已有提醒，不保证景点有票。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="confirm-pay-btn" bindtap="onConfirmPay">支付 {{confirmAmount}}</view>
  </view>
</view>
